Gaining XP levels takes exponential experience points.  Monster strength
tends to grow closer to linear.  Therefore in the early depths XP levels
can be gained about as easily as dungeon depth levels can be explored. 
It's a matter of being patient and thorough.

Somewhere between XP=5 and XP=10 the expontential price to get the next
slot/level makes waiting impractical.  The strategy of levels by levels
works well for me early in the game.  It fails completely somewhere
between the Oracle and Medusa.  Usually closer to the Oracle.


